** {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈænjʊləs/}}
** {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈænjələs/}}
** {{hyphenation|en|an|nu|lus}}
* {{glossary|Plural}} ({{m|en|annuli}}):
** {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈænjʊlaɪ/|/-li/}}
** {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈænjəlaɪ/|/-li/}}
** {{hyphenation|en|an|nu|li}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|+|annuli}}

# A [[ring]]- or [[donut]]-shaped [[area]] or [[structure]].
#: {{hyponyms|en|torus}}
# {{senseid|en|geometry}}{{lb|en|geometry}} The [[region]] in a [[plane]] between two [[concentric]] [[circle]]s of different [[radii]].
# {{lb|en|topology}} Any [[topological space]] [[homeomorphic]] to the region in a plane between two concentric circles of different radius.
#: {{synonyms|en|cylinder}}
# {{lb|en|astronomy}} The ring of the [[sun]] not covered by the [[moon]] in an [[annular eclipse|annular solar eclipse]].
# {{lb|en|botany}} Structure in a [[fern]] that consists of differentially thick-walled [[cell]]s on a [[sporangium]] that bend and [[distort]] as a result of drying.
# {{lb|en|mycology}} The membranous remnants of a [[partial veil]] which leaves a ring on the stem of a mushroom.
# {{lb|en|oil and gas production}} The space contained between the centre well bore and any external tubing. Sometimes used for separated gas flow.

